$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> XT-R-IME\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Not Too Bad\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and the <vServer::teamName1> are trapped on a small space station. Only problem... They hate each other.  War has broken out. You'r mission is to travel down to the other teams room and grab their flag and touch it to yours. HAVE FUN!\n\n<f1>Map By:<f0> Shit Jr. {|XK|} ICQ:41918549 Email: shitjr@hotmail.com \n\n<f1>Thanks to:<f0>Kill_Em_All_First and King_Shit."; ";

